            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Tram Thu Duc",
            "review_text": "Wetti\nVienna, Austria84 contributions\n0\nCozy little cafe off the beaten trail\nNov 2019\nIf you want to go to a nice but non touristic place, that's the place to visit! Nice, very cozy little cafe (also offering food), friendly service. About 15 Minutes by bus from the center, so not a lot of tourists there. But it's worth taking the little extra time to go there. The cafe is located in an old Vietnamese house, you can sit either on a terrace on the first floor or inside. Really charming place!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 8, 2019",
